# Keep media, lockfiles and build output out of Cursor's index and context.
# Same idea as Eci.Psn.StockService/.cursorignore. Cursor already skips .gitignore'd paths.

# Media and store assets
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.icns
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.pkg
hermes-mobile/fastlane/screenshots/
hermes-mobile/fastlane/store-capture/
hermes-mobile/fastlane/app_previews/
hermes-mobile/docs/store-assets/

# Lockfiles and build output
**/package-lock.json
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
